{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "A field only some items have is optional data: a where keeps the items that have it and hold (age > 20\nkeeps \"a\"), and \"is empty\" keeps the items without it (\"b\" has no age — an absent field reads as empty).",
  "step": [
